{%- comment -%}
  "Us vs. Other Brands" section: on the left a two-column table (your column is solid colour with small icons, the other brands column is white with grey crosses), on the right a heading, a tick list and a button with a guarantee line. On phones the heading comes first, then the table, then the button (the tick list is hidden, like the original).
  EDIT YOUR CONTENT BELOW.
  TABLE ROWS: one row = icon link ||| text in your column ||| text in the other column. Put @@ on its own line between rows.
  TICK LIST: one line = bold start ||| rest of the line. Put @@ on its own line between lines. Put the dash in the bold part, like the original (Clinically Studied Ingredients— ||| Ingredients proven to work).
  The picture links start as Metabolae's own files so the section is an exact copy straight away.
  Before you go live, download them, upload them to your own store (Content > Files) and paste your links here instead, so they keep working and are yours. Also replace all the wording, because it describes Metabolae's product.
  mb_img1 / mb_name1 = the picture above your column and its name. mb_img2 / mb_name2 = same for the other brands column. mb_img1_w / mb_img2_w = their width in pixels on desktop (phones use 90 and 75).
  mb_bg = section background. mb_col_bg = your column. mb_check_color = the tick inside the white circles. mb_cross_bg = the grey circle behind each cross.
  For your red: mb_bg #943434, mb_col_bg #612229, mb_check_color #943434.
  The button scrolls to your Add to cart area. These colours are locked, so the theme cannot turn them black.
  Do not use a straight apostrophe (') in the text, use &#39; instead. Do not type three | in a row inside a line except as the separators.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign mb_heading = 'Metabolae vs. Other Brands' -%}
{%- assign mb_button = 'Try Risk-Free Today' -%}
{%- assign mb_note = '90-day money back guarantee' -%}
{%- assign mb_bg = '#c47245' -%}
{%- assign mb_col_bg = '#a23b13' -%}
{%- assign mb_check_color = '#c47245' -%}
{%- assign mb_cross_bg = '#786d6d' -%}
{%- assign mb_name1 = 'Metabolae' -%}
{%- assign mb_img1 = 'https://metabolae.com/cdn/shop/files/Object_2.png?v=1779290542&width=200' -%}
{%- assign mb_img1_w = 120 -%}
{%- assign mb_name2 = 'Other Brands' -%}
{%- assign mb_img2 = 'https://metabolae.com/cdn/shop/files/Background_24.png?v=1779290625&width=200' -%}
{%- assign mb_img2_w = 100 -%}
